      <div type="clause" n="19">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 19</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{LXIII} Cyninges geneat, gif his wer bið twelfhund sciƚƚ, he mot swerian for syxtig hida, gif he bið huslgenga.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">A member of the king’s household, if his wer is 1,200 shillings, may swear [an oath in the value of] sixty hides, if he is a communicant.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">A member of the king's household if his wergeld is 1200 shillings, shall be allowed to swear for 60 hides, if he is a communicant.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Cyninges geneat, gif his wer bið CXX scll', he mot swerigan for LX hida, gif he bið huslgenga.</ab>
      </div>
